# Override Config (Hearts of Iron IV)
#
# See `cwt/core/00_overrides.cwt` for the format, strategies, confidence labels and sources.
# Only game-specific entries are listed here; unmatched paths default to `lios`.
#
# The official wiki does not provide a per-folder override strategy list for HOI4. In general, a
# file with the same name and path replaces the whole file, and the evaluation order decides
# precedence for overlapping definitions. No per-folder entries are currently known.
#
# Game-specific source:
# - Official Hearts of Iron 4 Wiki, "Modding" > "Universal modding concepts" > "Loading files":
#   https://hoi4.paradoxwikis.com/Modding
#
# See: docs/en/ref-config-format.md#config-override
# Version: 3.0.4-dev
# Date: 2026-10-02

